data: {"id": "3f1680e6104e4a0f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1116", "run_id": "3f1680e6104e4a0f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将基于已有的 baseline 结果，继续执行既定的 Kubernetes 诊断计划。\n\n**首轮可观测性基线事实速览：**\n- **Metrics (Prometheus):** Pod phase=Running (value=1)，restart_total=0。说明进程在运行，没有崩溃重启。\n- **Logging (Elasticsearch):** 近 30 分钟大量 `http_request` 错误日志，message=\"dependency unavailable\"，http_status=503，path=\"/work\"。\n- **Tracing (DeepFlow + Tempo):** 近 30 分钟大量 HTTP GET /work 请求，response_code=503。Tempo Span 中明确标记 `aiops.observed_mode=\"readiness_fail\"`，表示这些 503 被识别为 Readiness Probe 失败。\n\n基于这些事实，我将立即执行 `kubectl_describe`、`kubectl_get_yaml", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788810926429, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

